--TEST--
a `.` chain with no string in it is offered no html-template conversion, since there is no markup text to keep, and is offered only Put on separate lines, `rule:ide/a-string-converts-to-an-html-template`
--FILE--
<?nvs
int $a = 1;
int $b = 2;
echo $a . 42 . $<|>b;
--REQUEST--
codeAction
--EXPECT--
4:8-4:16 refactor.rewrite Put on separate lines -> "\n    . 42\n    . "
